FINAL_EVENT {"run_id": "r-ee99964793c2-0", "task_id": "retry-q2-t0545-t0001", "trace_id": "retry-q2-t0545-trace0001", "member_id": "s2-r0-m08", "planned_activity_id": "retry-q2-t0545-p0001", "phase_id": "phase2", "workday": 3, "simulation_time": "2025-05-07T09:00:00.028000+08:00", "event_type": "final_answer", "workflow_id": "bug_fix", "state": "completed", "answer": "The bug-fix workflow is complete and approved.\n\n**Summary:**\n- **Issue created:** `compute(a, b)` in `src/main.py` returned `None` instead of the difference of two finite numeric inputs.\n- **Reproduced:** `checks/public_check.py` failed with `AssertionError: compute(2,3) violates the specified difference` (returncode 1).\n- **Fix:** Rewrote `src/main.py` so `compute(a, b)` validates both inputs are finite numbers (raising `TypeError` for non-numeric, `ValueError` for NaN/±inf) and returns `a - b` — supporting zero, negative, and fractional values (e.g., `compute(2, 3)` → `-1`).\n- **Verified:** `/opt/anaconda3/bin/python checks/public_check.py` passed (returncode 0).\n- **PR opened and approved** in the local simulated review (approval artifact `d3c087fb1c2a`).", "status": "completed", "schema_version": "chimera-event/1", "event_seq": 28, "event_id": "c04690967f4449d0bec19867953671d3", "wall_time_utc": "2026-10-16T07:52:58.862277+00:00", "simulation_clock_kind": "task_start_plus_logical_order"}
